sequenceDiagram
    %% a write in review mode lands in the overlay, not on disk
    actor agent as Agent
    participant mcp as MCP server
    participant engine as Engine
    participant overlay as Review overlay
    participant disk as Domain folder
    agent->>mcp: write_engram
    mcp->>engine: write
    alt the domain is in review mode
        engine->>overlay: store the draft
        overlay-->>engine: draft id
        engine-->>mcp: awaiting review
    else direct write
        engine->>disk: emit the markdown file
        disk-->>engine: written
        engine-->>mcp: committed
    end
    mcp-->>agent: result
    Note over overlay,disk: an approval moves the draft to disk later
